  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have moved all my nodes off the bottom of the screen (using the Recenter button - lol) and now have apparently no way to scroll back down to see them.\n\nOn the scene view, I would normally be using the arrow keys for this, so that seems like sensible and consistent controls.\n\nEdit for new discovery: Turns out that the touchscreen also works for panning / scrolling the scene view, but again, not for Udon graph.\n\nEdit for another new discovery: Scrolling works fine on macOS using the touch surface on the mouse, even though scrolling on Windows doesn't work using the touch surface on the screen.\n",
